NOTE ON SCOPE

This MIT license covers the *tooling* in this repository: the DM dashboard
(dashboard.html), the scene schema (schema/), the adaptation protocol
(runtime/), and the original example adventure under
adventures/example_thornwell/, which is licensed content authored for this
project.

It does NOT grant any rights to third-party adventure material. Published,
commercial adventures (e.g. those by Wizards of the Coast or MCDM) remain the
property of their respective rights holders and are deliberately excluded from
this repository. Use this tooling with adventures you own or have the right to
adapt.
